<title>USA: Intertan names Ron Stegall chairman.</title>
<headline>Intertan names Ron Stegall chairman.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intertan Inc said Monday it named Ron Stegall chairman effective July 1.</p>
<p>Stegall is the chief executive officer of Arlington Equity Partners.</p>
<p>Stegall replaces John Capstick, who will retire. Capstick remains a director.</p>
